ther second in third place. In just ten laps the Frenchman had made up 28 seconds to the leader, despite the hellish speed by the top group.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":60,"text":"On lap 60, Nuvolari was in the lead with a time of 2h05m39s, Varzi again one second behind and Etancelin a further second in third place. In just ten laps the Frenchman had made up 28 seconds to the leader, despite the hellish speed by the top group.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":64,"text":"Fagioli stops with malfunctioning sparkplugs.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":64,"text":"Fagioli stops with malfunctioning sparkplugs.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":67,"text":"Fagioli retires.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":67,"text":"Fagioli retires.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":69,"text":"Etancelin is out: a ball bearing at the driveshaft fails.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":69,"text":"Etancelin is out: a ball bearing at the driveshaft fails.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":70,"text":"On lap 70, Nuvolari still kept the lead with 2h26.03s, one second ahead of Varzi. Borzacchini came next, followed after 90 seconds by Dreyfus in fourth place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":70,"text":"On lap 70, Nuvolari still kept the lead with 2h26.03s, one second ahead of Varzi. Borzacchini came next, followed after 90 seconds by Dreyfus in fourth place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":78,"text":"Varzi passes Nuvolari for the lead.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":78,"text":"Varzi passes Nuvolari for the lead.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":80,"text":"On lap 80, Varzi was still in the lead with 2h46m47s, an average speed of 91.519 km/h. Nuvolari followed one second behind with Borzacchini in third place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":80,"text":"On lap 80, Varzi was still in the lead with 2h46m47s, an average speed of 91.519 km/h. Nuvolari followed one second behind with Borzacchini in third place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":85,"text":"Half the cars had been eliminated when Falchetto's Bugatti retired due to rear axle breakage on lap 85.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":9},{"lap":85,"text":"Half the cars had been eliminated when Falchetto's Bugatti retired due to rear axle breakage on lap 85.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":9},{"lap":90,"text":"On lap 90, Nuvolari was leading with 3h07m23s. Although he was for the first time four seconds ahead of Varzi, the outcome of the race was by no means assured","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":90,"text":"On lap 90, Nuvolari was leading with 3h07m23s. Although he was for the first time four seconds ahead of Varzi, the outcome of the race was by no means assured","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":98,"text":"On lap 98, Varzi drew past Nuvolari's Alfa to the thunderous applause of the excited crowd. But the Mantuan re-passed his opponent as they raced up to the Casino.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":98,"text":"On lap 98, Varzi drew past Nuvolari's Alfa to the thunderous applause of the excited crowd. But the Mantuan re-passed his opponent as they raced up to the Casino.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":99,"text":"On lap 99 Varzi went even faster establishing a new record lap at 1m59s at 96.202 km/h average speed.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":99,"text":"On lap 99 Varzi went even faster establishing a new record lap at 1m59s at 96.202 km/h average speed.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":100,"text":"Then, on the last lap Varzi's blue car shot again into the lead and both cars entered the casino curve at breakneck speed in alarmingly close proximity.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":100,"text":"As Varzi celebrated at the finish, Nuvolari's red Alfa finally appeared out of the Tunnel, his engine had expired.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":100,"text":"When his stricken Alfa stopped, Nuvolari jumped out and while he pushed it all the way to the pits, Borzacchini and Dreyfus thundered past him to gain second and third places respectively.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":100,"text":"Helped to push by spectators and a mechanic, Nuvolari is disqualified.","q":false,"c":8},{"lap":100,"text":"Achille Varzi and Tazio Nuvolari exchanged the lead many times during the race and the race was settled in Varzi's favour on the final lap when Nuvolari's car caught fire due to over-revving.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":8},{"lap":100,"text":"Nuvolari was then disqualified due to outside assistance while attempting to push his car to the finish.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":8},{"lap":100,"text":"Then, on the last lap Varzi's blue car shot again into the lead and both cars entered the casino curve at breakneck speed in alarmingly close proximity.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":100,"text":"As Varzi celebrated at the finish, Nuvolari's red Alfa finally appeared out of the Tunnel, his engine had expired.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":100,"text":"When his stricken Alfa stopped, Nuvolari jumped out and while he pushed it all the way to the pits, Borzacchini and Dreyfus thundered past him to gain second and third places respectively.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":100,"text":"Helped to push by spectators and a mechanic, Nuvolari is disqualified.","q":false,"c":8},{"lap":100,"text":"Achille Varzi and Tazio Nuvolari exchanged the lead many times during the race and the race was settled in Varzi's favour on the final lap when Nuvolari's car caught fire due to over-revving.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":8},{"lap":100,"text":"Nuvolari was then disqualified due to outside assistance while attempting to push his car to the finish.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":8}]}